{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09910","headline":"佐郡思旧游 · 岑参","name":"佐郡思旧游","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幸得趋紫殿，却忆侍丹墀。\n史笔衆推直，谏书人莫窥。\n平生恒自负，垂老此安卑。\n同类皆先达，非才独後时。\n庭槐宿鸟乱，阶草夜虫悲。\n白发今无数，青云未有期。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09910.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09910","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}